<title>USA: American Homestar Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Homestar Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended May 31,</p>
<p> Fourth Quarter - Fiscal 1997	    1997		 1996</p>
<p>Average New Home Retail Selling Price</p>
<p>					$	 46,950   $	 44,211</p>
